%% TRIP-034 Styled multi-choice charter filters
%% The main flow: open a filter, choose, and the list and the other panels follow.
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor presses a filter button] --> B[Panel opens with checkboxes and counts]
    B --> C{Check or uncheck an option}
    C --> D[Choices written to the address - R3]
    D --> E{Continent changed?}
    E -- yes --> F[Countries outside the chosen continents are unchecked - R4]
    E -- no --> G[List filtered: any-of within, all-of between - R2]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Panels list only options with hits, and the chosen ones - R4]
    H --> C
    B --> I[Escape, click outside or another filter closes it - R1]
